---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const page = {
  title: "關於我們 - 中國北方馬鈴薯生產專家",
  h1: "關於我們 - 中國北方馬鈴薯生產專家",
  description: "DinWeys是張家口鼎威生技有限公司在中國的註冊商標。, 有限公司.",
  canonical: "/zh-tw/about-us/",
  author: " ",
  date: "2024-09-02",
};
const hreflang = "<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh-tw\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/zh-tw/about-us/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/about-us/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/about-us/\" />";
---
<BaseLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogType="website" lang="zh-TW" ogImage="/images/Food-Factory-1-1024x700.jpg" author=" "  datePublished="2024-09-02" dateModified="2024-09-02">
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center" id="h-about-dinweys">關於頓威</h2><p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><em>DinWeys是張家口鼎威生技有限公司在中國的註冊商標。, 有限公司.</em></p><p class="has-text-align-center has-contrast-2-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph">我們已將我們的商號從 XION 更改為 DinWeys 2024</p><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/Food-Factory-1.jpg" decoding="async" width="2090" height="1428" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-287" style="object-fit:cover;width:338px;height:300px" title="關於我們他冷凍薯條" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">馬鈴薯加工線</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img src="/images/office-1024x768.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-238" style="object-fit:cover;width:339px;height:300px" title="關於我們他冷凍薯條" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">我們的辦公室</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img src="/images/Company-Building-1024x768.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-208" style="object-fit:cover;width:339px;height:300px" title="關於我們冷凍薯條" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">總辦公大樓</figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/Production-line.jpg" decoding="async" width="1706" height="1279" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-240" style="object-fit:cover;width:360px;height:300px" title="關於我們冷凍薯條" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">在生產線</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/1.jpg" decoding="async" width="723" height="723" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-248" style="object-fit:cover;width:273px;height:300px" title="關於我們冷凍薯條" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Zia博士訪問</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img src="/images/2-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-249" style="object-fit:cover;width:267px;height:300px" title="關於我們冷凍薯條" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">紮實的合作夥伴</figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Dinweys Biotech Co., 有限公司.</strong> 是由中國投資者合資設立的製造和服務企業, 紐西蘭, 和台灣. 雖然我們提供多樣化的農業解決方案, 我們的 <strong>核心專長在於馬鈴薯深加工產品</strong>, 具體來說 <strong>洋芋片, 冷凍薯條, 和馬鈴薯澱粉</strong>.</p><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">地理位置優越，位於張家口市, 河北省 (160距北京公里)——一個以優質農業聞名的地區——我們也利用當地資源提供高品質的產品 <strong>亞麻籽, 藜麥, 和燕麥系列</strong>. 我們採用先進的加工技術, 包括滾筒乾燥, 凍乾, 擠壓, 和低溫加工, 創造優質原料.</p><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">在北岸設有額外的營運分支機構, 奧克蘭 (紐西蘭), 我們有能力有效地服務全球市場. 無論您是國際一線品牌還是成長型中小企業, 我們提供穩定的, 可靠的, 以及根據您的需求量身定制的具有成本效益的成分解決方案.</p></div></div><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/营业执照_001.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-233" style="width:400px" title="關於我們冷凍薯條" width="7016" height="4960" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">DINWEYS商業許可證</figcaption></figure></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column has-medium-font-size is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>公司驗證聲明 </strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>公司名稱:</strong> Zhangjiakou Dingwei Biotechnology Co., 有限公司.<br><strong>統一社會信用代碼 (營業執照號碼):</strong> 91130702MADY9DX57U<br><strong>海關註冊號:</strong> 1307961A3J<br><strong>註冊於:</strong> Zhangjiakou City, 河北省, 中國</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">我們是一家在中國合法註冊和經營的生物科技公司. 您可以透過官方且值得信賴的第三方平台驗證我們的商業登記:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><a class="" href="https://www.gsxt.gov.cn" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">國家企業信用資訊公示系統 (中國)</a></li><li><a class="" href="https://www.qcc.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Qichacha (中國商業資料庫)</a></li><li><a class="" href="https://www.registerchina.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">註冊中國網</a> <em>(非官方, 僅供參考)</em></li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph">我公司遵守中國所有適用的法律法規並保持透明的公司結構. 如果您需要進一步驗證, 我們很樂意提供額外的文件，例如掃描的營業執照, 稅務證明, 海關註冊證明, 或第三方審計報告.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">如有任何業務驗證需求，請隨時與我們.</p></div></div><p class="has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://dotheygobad.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Tech Mange Martin 的部落格由我們團隊支持 </a></p>`} />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
